# Explicit allowlist behaviour: exclude everything noisy, but do NOT exclude
# formd/formd.db. Fly's builder falls back to .gitignore when this file is
# missing, and .gitignore has *.db, which would silently ship an image with no
# database in it.
.git
.venv
__pycache__
*.pyc
.env
.env.op
.cloudflared-token
twilio-base
docs/superpowers
web/trace.jsonl
*.md
!requirements.txt
